<%# The simple inline chip Lexxy shows for a mention *inside the editor* — both when
    inserting one via the @-prompt and when editing a stored message. Everything here
    is phrasing content so it stays within Lexxy's <p>; the interactive click-to-profile
    popup (users/mention) is only for display, not for the composer. %>
<span class="mention" sgid="<%= user.attachable_sgid %>"><%= avatar_tag user %> <%= user.name %></span>
